15\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1405\" data-start=\"1317\">Exclusively curated furniture made from solid wood, iron, and other quality materials.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1481\" data-start=\"1406\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1481\" data-start=\"1408\">Sustainably sourced and ethically crafted &ndash; a story behind every piece.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1482\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1484\">We offer <strong data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1493\">free shipping, no customs or duties</strong> in the EU, UK, USA, and Canada.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1569\">Happy customers and premium service &ndash; your referrals are in good hands.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1852\" data-start=\"1644\"></p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1852\" data-start=\"1644\">📝&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1663\" data-start=\"1647\">How It Works</strong><br data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1663\"><strong data-end=\"1677\" data-start=\"1666\">Sign up</strong> &ndash; Join our affiliate program in minutes.<br data-end=\"1721\" data-start=\"1718\"><strong data-end=\"1732\" data-start=\"1721\">Promote</strong> &ndash; Share your unique link and inspire your audience.<br data-end=\"1787\" data-start=\"1784\"><strong data-end=\"1795\" data-start=\"1787\">Earn</strong> &ndash; Get 5% commission on every successful referral sale.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2071\" data-start=\"1854\">Whether you're a content creator, interior designer, blogger or simply a fan of great design &ndash; we'd love to have you on board.<br data-end=\"1983\" data-start=\"1980\">Let&rsquo;s grow together and bring timeless, beautiful interiors to homes around the world.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"2073\">👉 <strong data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"2076\">Join the Atelia Studio family today!</strong></p>",
